*--------------------------*                                                    
                                                                                
**** FIL TILL ONDEMAND                                                          
FILE W51738D2 PRINTER FB(129 0)                                                 
                                                                                
* WEBFIL FÖR ALLA DC (FIL FÖR DAP). LDC-LISTORNA VASKAS                         
* SEDAN FRAM UR DENNA FIL I FÖLJANDE PGM W5173900                               
FILE W51738DW FB(64  0)                                                         
%W517391 'UT-'                                                                  
*                                                                               
**** EXCEL-FIL, SKICKAS SOM MAIL VIA DAP  I JCL W517J139                        
FILE W51738D9 PRINTER VB(133 0)                                                 
UT1-BEPRODSL               W 24  A                                              
UT1-KOMM                   W  5  A                                              
UT1-STD-VECKA              W  6  N 0  MASK 'ZZZ ZZZ-'                           
UT1-STD-VSNITT             W  6  N 0  MASK 'ZZZ ZZZ-'                           
UT1-STD-ACK                W  6  N 0  MASK 'ZZZ ZZZ-'                           
UT1-STD-ACK-DIFFP          W  6  N 2  MASK 'ZZZ9,99-'                           
UT1-STD-DIFF               W  6  N 0  MASK 'ZZZ ZZZ-'                           
UT1-STD-DIFF-PROC          W  5  N 0  MASK 'ZZZZ9-'                             
                                                                                
**** EXCEL-FIL, SKICKAS SOM MAIL VIA DAP  I JCL W517J139                        
FILE W51738DD        VB(87 0)                                                   
XL-HEADER            1 87 A                                                     
XLFILE               W 87 A                                                     
XL-IDDC  XLFILE        2  A                                                     
XL-SEM1  XLFILE    +2  1  A  VALUE ';'                                          
XL-PS    XLFILE    +3  24 A                                                     
XL-SEM2  XLFILE    +27 1  A  VALUE ';'                                          
XL-UP-WK XLFILE    +28 10 N                                                     
XL-SEM3  XLFILE    +38 1  A  VALUE ';'                                          
XL-DN-WK XLFILE    +39 10 N                                                     
XL-SEM4  XLFILE    +49 1  A  VALUE ';'                                          
XL-UP-YR XLFILE    +50 10 N                                                     
XL-SEM5  XLFILE    +60 1  A  VALUE ';'                                          
XL-DN-YR XLFILE    +61 10 N                                                     
XL-SEM6  XLFILE    +71 1  A  VALUE ';'                                          
XL-SL-YR XLFILE    +72 10 N                                                     
XL-SEM7  XLFILE    +82 1  A  VALUE ';'                                          
                                                                                
*-------------*                                                                 
* ARBETSAREOR *                                                                 
*-------------*                                                                 
WS-IDDC               W  2 A                                                    
W-BEPRODSL            W 24  A                                                   
IX               W   2   P   0                                                  
                                                                                
BEPRODSL                W 28  A    OCCURS 98                                    
BEPRODSL-PS  BEPRODSL      3  N                                                 
BEPRODSL-TXT BEPRODSL  +3 24  A                                                 
                                                                                
W-TOTAL               W  5  A    VALUE 'TOTAL'                                  
W-KOMM                W  5  A                                                   
W-STD-VECKA           W  6  N 0  MASK 'ZZZ ZZZ-'                                
W-STD-VSNITT          W  6  N 0  MASK 'ZZZ ZZZ-'                                
W-STD-ACK             W  6  N 0  MASK 'ZZZ ZZZ-'                                
W-STD-ACK-DIFFP       W  6  N 2  MASK 'ZZZ9,99-'                                
W-STD-DIFF            W  6  N 0  MASK 'ZZZ ZZZ-'                                
W-STD-DIFF-PROC       W  5  N 0  MASK 'ZZZZ9-'                                  
                                                                                
*** FÖR EXCELEN                                                                 
W-WEEK       W   11  A                                                          
W-HEAD  W-WEEK   5   A VALUE 'WEEK '                                            
W-DAT   W-WEEK  +7 3 A                                                          
W-COLON W-WEEK  +10 1 A VALUE ';'                                               
NEWPAGE                                                                         
*    --- VALID IDDC CODES                                                       
*                                                                               
%WWDC99                                                                         
*                                                                               
                                                                                
AKT-IDDC            W                    6  A                                   
                                                                                
AKT-DAVVREG         W                    6  N                                   
AKT-SEKEL           AKT-DAVVREG          2  N                                   
AKT-AAR             AKT-DAVVREG +2       2  N                                   
AKT-VV              AKT-DAVVREG +4       2  N                                   
                                                                                
W-DATUM              W                   6  N                                   
W-AAR  W-DATUM                           2  N                                   
W-MM   W-DATUM                       +2  2  N                                   
W-DD   W-DATUM                       +4  2  N                                   
                                                                                
TRANS-DAVVREG       W                    6  N                                   
TRANS-SEKEL         TRANS-DAVVREG        2  N                                   
TRANS-AAR           TRANS-DAVVREG +2     2  N                                   
TRANS-VV            TRANS-DAVVREG +4     2  N                                   
                                                                                
F-AAR               W                    2  N                                   
                                                                                
DX                  W                    3  N                                   
PX                  W                    3  N                                   
                                                                                
NEWPAGE                                                                         
*--------------------------*                                                    
* DATUMKORT                *                                                    
*--------------------------*                                                    
                                                                                
PROGRAM-NAMN   W    8    A        VALUE 'W5173800'                              
DATUMKORT-ID   W    6    A        VALUE 'WDATUM'                                
                                                                                
%WDATKORT                                                                       
NEWPAGE                                                                         
*-------------*                                                                 
* JOBSTEG 1   *                                                                 
*-------------*                                                                 
                                                                                
JOB INPUT (W51738D1) START A-INIT                                               
                                                                                
   TRANS-DAVVREG = RW1-DAVVREG                                                  
                                                                                
   IF RW1-KDPRODSL NE 0                                                         
     IF RW1-KDWRTYP = 0110                                                      
*****  SKAPA  STD-UTFALLS-TRANS, FRÅN RW1-POSTER  **********                    
       PERFORM SKAPA-STD-UTFALLS-TRANS                                          
     ELSE                                                                       
       IF RW2-KDWRTYP = 0421 0422                                               
****   KDWRTYP = 0421 0422 FINNS ENDAST FÖR RW2-POSTYPEN                        
****   SKAPA GJORDA INVENTERINGAR UNDER VECKAN/ÅRET-TRANS                       
         PERFORM SKAPA-GJORDA-INV-TRANS                                         
       END-IF                                                                   
     END-IF                                                                     
   END-IF                                                                       
                                                                                
NEWPAGE                                                                         
                                                                                
A-INIT. PROC                                                                    
  CALL DATKORT USING (PROGRAM-NAMN DATUMKORT-ID DATUMKORT)                      
  AKT-SEKEL    = 20                                                             
  AKT-AAR      = D-AAR                                                          
  AKT-VV       = D-VECKA                                                        
  F-AAR        = AKT-AAR - 1                                                    
                                                                                
  W-AAR  = D-AAR                                                                
  W-MM   = D-MAANAD                                                             
  W-DD   = D-DAG                                                                
                                                                                
****  INITIERA TABELL ******                                                    
  BEPRODSL(01) =       '011SPARE PARTS VCC'                                     
  BEPRODSL(02) =       '012               '                                     
  BEPRODSL(03) =       '013CHEMICALS VCCS'                                      
  BEPRODSL(04) =       '014EXCHANGE VCC'                                        
